    <string name="welcome_battery_description">To ensure Ondy works reliably, please disable battery optimization.\n\n⚠️ Note: Some phone manufacturers (Samsung, Xiaomi, OnePlus, Oppo, Vivo, Huawei, etc.) have additional restrictions. You may need to manually allow background activity in your device\'s app settings.</string>
